4-602.11 The following were observed to be soiled:
1) tea nozzle at drive thru (mold);
2) side of ice shoot at drive thru soda machine (pink mold);
3) nozzles of lobby soda machine (mold);  and
4) nozzle of BUNN hot water dispenser.
Equipment such as beverage dispensing nozzles and ice shuts on soda machines shall be cleaned at a frequency specified by the manufacturer, or absent manufacturer specifications, at a frequency necessary to preclude accumulation of soil or mold.
